ed_tax = 0.0 if rebate_eligible else round(taxable_income * 0.10, 2)\n84: \n85:     return TaxCalculationResponse("}
{"step_index":2125,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-03T08:45:03Z","input_tokens":2950,"cache_read_tokens":94371,"output_tokens":1409,"thinking":"The taxable income calculation appears incorrect; it's missing the deduction for purchase costs. Correcting line 73 to subtract both current invoice subtotal and operating expenses from annual turnover should fix it. Now, examining the tax regime calculations, specifically the new slab calculations, to ensure this change doesn't introduce any new calculation errors.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"\"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/routes/tax_advisory.py\"","Replacement":"\"    else:\\n        total_expenses = req.current_invoice_subtotal + req.operating_expenses\\n        taxable_income = max(0.0, req.annual_turnover - total_expenses)\\n        itr_form = \\\"ITR-3\\\"\\n        tax_audit = req.annual_turnover > (100000000.0 if req.digital_share_percent >= 95.0 else 10000000.0)\\n        msg = \\\"Regular business filing. Maintain vouchers, purchase invoices, and expense registers.\\\"\\n\\n    taxable_income = round(taxable_income, 2)\\n\\n    # 3. Tax Slabs (New Tax Regime FY 2025-26 / 2026-27 with Sec 87A rebate & 75k standard deduction)\\n    net_taxable = max(0.0, taxable_income - 75000.0)\\n    base_tax = 0.0\\n    if net_taxable > 300000.0:\\n        if net_taxable <= 700000.0:\\n            base_tax = (net_taxable - 300000.0) * 0.05\\n        elif net_taxable <= 1000000.0:\\n            base_tax = 20000.0 + (net_taxable - 700000.0) * 0.10\\n        elif net_taxable <= 1200000.0:\\n            base_tax = 50000.0 + (net_taxable - 1000000.0) * 0.15\\n        elif net_taxable <= 1500000.0:\\n            base_tax = 80000.0 + (net_taxable - 1200000.0) * 0.20\\n        else:\\n            base_tax = 140000.0 + (net_taxable - 1500000.0) * 0.30\\n\\n    rebate_eligible = net_taxable <= 700000.0\\n    rebate = base_tax if rebate_eligible else 0.0\\n    tax_after_rebate = max(0.0, base_tax - rebate)\\n    cess = round(tax_after_rebate * 0.04, 2)\\n    projected_tax = round(tax_after_rebate + cess, 2)\"","Target":"\"    else:\\n        taxable_income = max(0.0, req.annual_turnover - req.operating_expenses)\\n        itr_form = \\\"ITR-3\\\"\\n        tax_audit = req.annual_turnover > 10000000.0\\n        msg = \\\"Regular business filing. Maintain vouchers, purchase invoices, and expense registers.\\\"\\n\\n    taxable_income = round(taxable_income, 2)\\n\\n    # 3. Tax Slabs (New Tax Regime FY 2025-26 / 2026-27 with Sec 87A rebate)\\n    # Under New Regime, income up to 7 Lakhs (or extended limits) gets full 87A rebate\\n    rebate_eligible = taxable_income <= 700000.0\\n    projected_tax = 0.0 if rebate_eligible else round(taxable_income * 0.10, 2)\""}}]}
